## Known Remaining Limitations

| # | Limitation | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|-----------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | `POSTGRES_PASSWORD` not in `.env` | Docker DB fails to start until added | Add before `docker compose up` |
| 2 | Docker not installed on this machine | Container runtime unverifiable | Install Docker Desktop |
| 3 | Local file storage (`UPLOAD_DIR`) | Multi-node deployments lose files | Migrate to S3/Azure Blob |
| 4 | ChromaDB local persistence | Not suitable for high-volume multi-tenant | Pinecone/Qdrant for scale |
| 5 | `BackgroundTasks` resilience | Job state lost on restart | Celery + Redis for enterprise |
| 6 | Scanned PDF (image-only) not supported | OCR not implemented | `pytesseract` or cloud OCR |
| 7 | SSE over enterprise firewalls | Streams may drop | WebSocket fallback |
| 8 | No TLS in-repo | HTTPS requires external terminator | AWS ALB / Cloudflare / certbot |

